  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is music class. Teacher Kim says, \"Let's start!\" The children sing. Lily claps her hands. Mia claps too. \"Look at me,\" says Teacher Kim. She claps one, two, three. The children clap one, two, three. \"Good!\" she says. \"Stop, please.\" The music stops.",
      "\"Now let's play a game,\" says Teacher Kim. \"It is a football game.\" Leo has the ball. He has number five. \"Can you kick it?\" asks May. \"Yes, I can!\" says Leo. He kicks the ball. Mia runs and kicks it too. Lily has number three. She kicks the ball to May. May kicks it to Leo.",
      "\"Stop, please,\" says Teacher Kim. The children stop. \"It is time to go home.\" \"Oh no!\" says Leo. \"Can we play again?\" \"Yes, in the next lesson,\" says Teacher Kim. \"Goodbye, class!\" \"Goodbye, Teacher Kim!\" Lily smiles. It is a fun day."
    ],
